{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released invocation-end ordering contract.** Existing API documentation promised registration order, so reversing legacy end hooks can break plugins with ordering dependencies during a patch upgrade. Keep forward order for existing plugins and add an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in for scope-owning plugins, including mixed-order compatibility tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7748wz","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"e78d4c3e1e6668ea78cbd6706ebb4f8469bed31f31252cf76fed035836d1d4c0","observation_id":"aro_v1_46guypq6mzuou6gl2zyg5o2pqr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_miy3nph6wuhtx5lw47zhwpb4pu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"be44fd7d1447323978b318872275a4db5afef6f1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_lo3iyet5xvrw6xgti27cyb7quf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
